PROJECT: BUILD A COMPLETE CLASSIC-ERA MOBILE BATTLE ROYALE GAME

1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior 3D game developer, battle-royale game designer, gameplay programmer, artificial intelligence engineer, graphics programmer, physics developer, mobile optimization specialist, UI/UX designer, and quality-assurance engineer.

Your assignment is to develop an original, playable 3D battle-royale game inspired by the broad gameplay experience and nostalgic atmosphere of Free Fire during approximately 2018–2020.

I want the simplicity, fast-paced matches, tropical environments, straightforward controls, colorful character customization, and enjoyable survival gameplay associated with that era.

Do not create a modern game overloaded with menus, complicated character abilities, excessive visual effects, aggressive monetization, or unnecessary interface elements.

The result must be an original game with its own identity.

Working title: CLASSIC DROP.

You may improve the name if you have a better original suggestion.

I am developing this project entirely on an Android phone using Google AI Studio. I do not have a PC.

Therefore, design the development process around browser-based tools and a mobile-compatible workflow.

Your primary objective is to implement a working game, not merely describe a possible game or generate a static visual mockup.

